80/extras/8f94e42ee357f604f529e9d6c1600975.mp4?t=1774501179\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and Enjoyable Atmosphere</strong><br>The clash of balls, the flying coins, and the activation of cards\u2026 Plinbo offers not only intelligence and strategy but also a visual feast.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect simualted ball movements, go left or right!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern retro feel with CRT effect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying visual and sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your luck and strategy\u2026 <strong>Prove yourself in the world of Plinbo!</strong></p>","developers":["Raphus & Co."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948580/7634542dad3f3d6d897aedfce0672559937adb68/header.jpg?t=1774501179","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 - Raphus & Co., Published by Rogue Duck Interactive LLC and Co-published in Asia Regions (China, Korea, Japan) by Gamersky Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, SteamOS (Proton-8 Recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8 or higher, ATI X1600 or higher, or Intel HD 3000 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL Compatible Sound Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Proton-8 Recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><